OL,3,GNEWSAUnlicensed dog breeder hid puppies
OL,4,Ain a box
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn unlicensed dog breeder who kept
OL,7,Fpuppies hidden in a box and left other
OL,8,Fanimals without access to water has
OL,9,Fbeen sentenced.
OL,11,FThe dogs were found in cramped
OL,12,Fconditions at Kathleen Warner's house
OL,13,Fin Woodgreen Close, Desborough,
OL,14,FNorthamptonshire, in August 2025.
OL,16,FThe illegal operation was uncovered by
OL,17,Fofficers from North Northamptonshire
OL,18,FCouncil, who then took Warner to court.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,368,360,200,160,0,100
