OL,3,GNEWSAUnlicensed dog breeder hid puppies
OL,4,Ain a box
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe was given a 16-week suspended
OL,7,Fprison sentence by a magistrate in
OL,8,FWellingborough and banned from keeping
OL,9,Fdogs for five years.
